                                <div id="DeltaPlaceHolderMain">
	
                            <a id="mainContent" name="mainContent" tabindex="-1"></a>
                            
		
		<div class="RIJ-Page">
            <div class="row">
				<div class="col-xs-12 col-md-9">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-xs-12">
                            <div class="ms-webpart-zone ms-fullWidth">
		<div id="MSOZoneCell_WebPartWPQ2" class="s4-wpcell-plain ms-webpartzone-cell ms-webpart-cell-vertical-inline-table ms-webpart-cell-vertical ms-fullWidth ">
			<div class="ms-webpart-chrome ms-webpart-chrome-vertical ms-webpart-chrome-fullWidth ">
				<div class="ms-webpart-chrome-title" id="WebPartWPQ2_ChromeTitle">
					<span title="Civil - Allows authors to enter rich text content." id="WebPartTitleWPQ2" class="js-webpart-titleCell"><h2 style="text-align:justify;" class="ms-webpart-titleText">&nbsp;<span>Civil</span><span id="WebPartCaptionWPQ2"></span></h2></span>
				</div><div WebPartID="9cfc84f7-58b8-4ea2-9c79-7c9f27f003c0" HasPers="false" id="WebPartWPQ2" width="100%" class="ms-WPBody ms-wpContentDivSpace " allowDelete="false" style="" ><div class="ms-rtestate-field">
<div>The District Court has exclusive jurisdiction of all civil actions at law wherein the amount in controversy is under $5,000. The court has concurrent original jurisdiction with the Superior Court
 of all civil actions at law wherein the amount in controversy exceeds the sum of $5,000 and does not exceed $10,000. However, in any such action if one (1) or more of the defendants in the answer 
 to the complaint demand removal of the action to the Superior Court, in which event the action shall proceed as if it had been filed originally in the Superior Court.<br/>​<br/></div></div><div class="ms-clear"></div></div>
			</div><div class="ms-PartSpacingVertical"></div>
		</div><div id="MSOZoneCell_WebPartWPQ4" class="s4-wpcell-plain ms-webpartzone-cell ms-webpart-cell-vertical-inline-table ms-webpart-cell-vertical ms-fullWidth ">
			<div class="ms-webpart-chrome ms-webpart-chrome-vertical ms-webpart-chrome-fullWidth ">
				<div WebPartID="d2966571-75dc-497b-a8a7-7d4302b831c1" HasPers="false" id="WebPartWPQ4" width="100%" class="ms-WPBody " allowDelete="false" style="" ><div class="ms-rtestate-field"><table style="border-spacing: 20px; width: 100%; border-collapse: separate !important;">
   <tbody> 
      <tr>
         <td style="background-color: #1e1e62; border-radius: 5px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.25em; padding: 20px 15px; text-align: center; width: 33.33%;"> 
            <a href="/Courts/districtcourt/Pages/General-Info-on-Civil-Matters.aspx" style="color: white; text-decoration: none;">General Information 
               <br/>on Civil Matters</a></td>
         <td style="background-color: #1e1e62; border-radius: 5px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.25em; padding: 20px 15px; text-align: center; width: 33.33%;"> 
            <a href="/Courts/districtcourt/Pages/Domestic-Abuse-Restraining.aspx" style="color: white; text-decoration: none;">Domestic Abuse 
               <br/> Restraining Orders</a></td>
         <td style="background-color: #1e1e62; border-radius: 5px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.25em; padding: 20px 15px; text-align: center; width: 33.33%;"> 
            <a href="/Courts/districtcourt/Pages/Vicious-Dog-Complaints.aspx" style="color: white; text-decoration: none;">Vicious Dog Complaints​<br/> (G.L. 1956 § 4-13.1-11)</a></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
         <td style="background-color: #1e1e62; border-radius: 5px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.25em; padding: 20px 15px; text-align: center; width: 33.33%;"> 
            <a href="/Courts/districtcourt/Pages/Small%20Claims.aspx" style="color: white; text-decoration: none;">Small Claims Cases</a></td>
         <td style="background-color: #1e1e62; border-radius: 5px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.25em; padding: 20px 15px; text-align: center; width: 33.33%;"> 
            <a href="/Courts/districtcourt/Pages/Landlord%20Tenant.aspx" style="color: white; text-decoration: none;">Landlord/Tenant Evictions</a></td>
         <td style="background-color: #1e1e62; border-radius: 5px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.25em; padding: 20px 15px; text-align: center; width: 33.33%;"> 
            <a href="/Courts/districtcourt/Pages/Post-conviction-Relief.aspx" style="color: white; text-decoration: none;">Post-conviction Relief</a>​​​​​​<br/></td>
      </tr>
   </tbody> 
</table>​​​</div><div class="ms-clear"></div></div>
